    <comment>New package python-comfyui-workflow-templates for openSUSE:Factory from science:machinelearning (ComfyUI cone). pluskalm is the science:machinelearning package maintainer.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together with the ComfyUI cone (see comment on sr#1372800).

Fri Aug 21 08:51:33 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Initial package (version 0.11.44): meta package for ComfyUI
  workflow templates, requiring:
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-core = 0.3.315
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-json = 0.1.50
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-api = 0.3.84
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-video = 0.3.101
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-image = 0.3.160
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-other = 0.3.229
  * python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-assets-01 = 0.1.30
</comment>
